Note for ECL-2.0: 
The content of the NOTICE file must be made available in readable form. The content of the NOTICE file is made available in readable form as acknowledgement.


Note for Eclipse-Foundation-Specification-License-v1.0: 
The acknowledgment must contain:
Copyright © [$date-of-document] Eclipse Foundation AISBL. This software or document includes material copied from or derived from [title and URI of the Eclipse Foundation specification document]. The license of the material is available in this document or at [url to this license]

