-the acknowledgement text must contain the text:
Contains information from DATABASE NAME, which is made available here under the Open Database License (ODbL) the text of the license is available in this document.

Eplanation from the license: DATABASE NAME should be replaced with the name of the Database and a hyperlink to the URI of the Database. "Open Database License" should contain a hyperlink to the URI of the text of this License. If hyperlinks are not possible, You should include the plain text of the required URI's with the above notice.

